WEBVTT

01:14.480 --> 01:19.344
[Meet Yourself]

01:20.000 --> 01:22.680
[Episode 26]

01:31.972 --> 01:32.612
Look.

01:32.612 --> 01:34.162
Aunt E's dried fish.

01:34.162 --> 01:34.892
Well dried.

01:34.892 --> 01:35.692
Yes.

01:35.692 --> 01:36.992
Better than mine.

01:40.252 --> 01:41.732
What is she doing?

01:42.792 --> 01:43.363
I don't know.

01:43.363 --> 01:44.663
She's exercising.

01:46.252 --> 01:47.924
Is she dizzy?

01:48.002 --> 01:49.282
I don't know.

01:49.362 --> 01:50.612
Look.

01:50.612 --> 01:51.892
Her waist.

01:52.252 --> 01:53.362
Look at it.

01:53.362 --> 01:54.650
What's wrong?

01:54.922 --> 01:58.994
Before Yang was born, my
waist was just 1.8 feet thick.

01:59.132 --> 02:00.412
Now I'm not.

02:00.562 --> 02:01.958
You, either.

02:04.602 --> 02:05.812
Good morning.

02:05.812 --> 02:06.442
Hello.

02:06.442 --> 02:08.252
Did you come yesterday?

02:08.252 --> 02:09.442
Yes.

02:09.442 --> 02:11.002
This is Aunt Baoping.

02:11.002 --> 02:12.578
I'm Aunt Gui.

02:12.602 --> 02:16.441
One-third of the homestead in
this yard is owned by my family.

02:16.442 --> 02:19.122
So I'm the landlady.

02:19.442 --> 02:22.132
I'm responsible for the sanitation of the yard.

02:22.132 --> 02:23.432
What's your name?

02:23.762 --> 02:24.762
I'm Bai Manjun.

02:24.762 --> 02:26.722
Just call me Bai.

02:27.252 --> 02:28.482
Bai.

02:28.482 --> 02:30.298
What are you doing?

02:30.562 --> 02:31.842
Doing yoga.

02:31.972 --> 02:33.488
What is yoga?

02:33.932 --> 02:36.042
Almost the same as what Ma did.

02:36.042 --> 02:38.002
Ma sat here motionless.

02:38.002 --> 02:40.372
But she moves and handstands.

02:40.372 --> 02:41.282
Right?

02:41.282 --> 02:42.562
What?

02:43.042 --> 02:44.272
Keep on.

02:44.272 --> 02:45.632
Let's go upstairs.

02:49.882 --> 02:52.018
Why isn't she dizzy?

02:52.042 --> 02:54.254
Young people are never dizzy.

02:55.932 --> 02:57.602
Dried bamboo shoots.

02:57.602 --> 02:59.382
Lurid bolete.

02:59.482 --> 03:01.166
All for you.

03:01.532 --> 03:02.562
Don't be afraid.

03:02.562 --> 03:04.812
Not toxic.

03:04.812 --> 03:06.628
I'm not afraid.

03:07.252 --> 03:09.032
Aunt Gui, I'm not afraid.

03:09.092 --> 03:10.162
Well.

03:10.162 --> 03:11.252
Too much.

03:11.252 --> 03:12.562
Really too much.

03:12.562 --> 03:18.422
You need more so that
your parents can eat more.

03:18.852 --> 03:21.532
The milk fans and sausages are from me.

03:21.532 --> 03:22.562
Thanks.

03:22.562 --> 03:25.068
This is from Feng.

03:25.092 --> 03:27.532
Dried peaches and apples.

03:27.532 --> 03:30.482
Picked from her trees.

03:30.482 --> 03:32.442
Quite natural.

03:32.852 --> 03:34.412
The dried peaches are great.

03:34.412 --> 03:36.264
It can make water sweet.

03:36.762 --> 03:37.812
Thank you.

03:37.812 --> 03:43.036
Granny Xiuying's chili and sesame.

03:43.092 --> 03:46.012
Granny Caiyun's black soybeans and soybeans.

03:47.092 --> 03:48.392
Where's E's fish?

03:48.482 --> 03:49.252
Where?

03:49.252 --> 03:50.532
Here.

03:50.602 --> 03:51.882
Dried fish.

03:54.282 --> 03:56.542
How will you take all these back?

03:57.162 --> 03:58.722
They're beyond my reach. Really.

03:58.722 --> 04:00.002
Well.

04:00.092 --> 04:03.762
I haven't given you any
gifts or done anything for you.

04:03.762 --> 04:05.932
They're just our gratefulness.

04:05.932 --> 04:08.532
During your volunteer work,
you have been very busy

04:08.532 --> 04:10.240
and helped Yao a lot.

04:10.802 --> 04:12.532
We all like you.

04:12.532 --> 04:17.084
Grannies and aunts here
don't want you to leave.

04:17.282 --> 04:21.282
Hongdou, after you
leave, don't forget us.

04:21.282 --> 04:24.166
Remember to visit us one day.

04:24.452 --> 04:27.412
Hongdou is too busy to see us.

04:27.412 --> 04:29.428
Just make a call.

04:29.452 --> 04:31.282
Video call.

04:31.282 --> 04:32.562
Yes.

04:37.482 --> 04:39.282
I've prepared some gifts.

04:39.282 --> 04:40.452
Some are unopened.

04:40.452 --> 04:42.172
All for you.

04:44.122 --> 04:44.972
Hulu.

04:44.972 --> 04:45.572
I'm here.

04:45.572 --> 04:46.282
Tuotuo.

04:46.282 --> 04:46.682
I'm here.

04:46.682 --> 04:47.362
Huzi.

04:47.362 --> 04:47.682
Here.

04:47.682 --> 04:48.212
Guobao.

04:48.212 --> 04:49.162
I also want!

04:49.162 --> 04:50.462
Say "here".

04:50.532 --> 04:51.262
Here.

04:51.262 --> 04:52.542
Come on.

04:52.602 --> 04:53.572
Here you are.

04:53.572 --> 04:55.088
Thank you.

04:56.242 --> 04:57.242
Here you are.

04:57.242 --> 04:58.686
Thank you.

04:59.242 --> 05:00.770
Thank you.

05:02.092 --> 05:03.476
Thank you.

05:05.042 --> 05:07.194
Hongdou, what's this?

05:07.242 --> 05:08.452
Luban lock.

05:08.452 --> 05:10.460
Luban lock?

05:11.532 --> 05:12.892
Make a promise.

05:12.892 --> 05:18.722
After I leave, accompany Granny
Xie at Yao's home more often.

05:18.722 --> 05:19.532
OK?

05:19.532 --> 05:20.452
OK.

05:20.452 --> 05:21.722
Can she play?

05:21.722 --> 05:22.652
You can teach her.

05:22.652 --> 05:23.932
OK.

05:24.282 --> 05:25.282
Hongdou.

05:25.282 --> 05:28.406
Will you see me with Lingdang?

05:31.042 --> 05:32.092
I don't know.

05:32.092 --> 05:35.624
After you leave, who will marry Yao?

05:37.412 --> 05:38.572
I don't know, either.

05:38.572 --> 05:41.282
When will you hold a feast
with combined cooking?

05:41.282 --> 05:42.532
I want to eat sugary rice.

05:42.532 --> 05:44.122
Me, too!

05:44.122 --> 05:46.910
Come on. They won't get married.

05:47.362 --> 05:49.922
No combined cooking.

05:49.922 --> 05:52.518
No sugary rice.

05:56.602 --> 05:59.092
1, 2, 3.

05:59.092 --> 06:01.778
1, 2, 3.

06:01.802 --> 06:04.158
1, 2, 3.

06:04.242 --> 06:07.018
1, 2, 3.

06:07.042 --> 06:09.434
1, 2, 3.

06:09.572 --> 06:12.338
1, 2, 3.

06:12.362 --> 06:15.042
1, 2, 3.

06:15.452 --> 06:16.212
It will get out!

06:16.212 --> 06:17.492
Come on!

06:24.012 --> 06:24.972
Done.

06:24.972 --> 06:25.602
Thank you, bro.

06:25.602 --> 06:26.602
Thank you.

06:26.602 --> 06:27.122
Jiu.

06:27.122 --> 06:28.282
I have something to do.

06:28.282 --> 06:29.572
OK. Thanks, Yao.

06:29.572 --> 06:30.162
Not at all.

06:30.162 --> 06:30.602
Bye-bye.

06:30.602 --> 06:31.682
Thanks.

06:31.682 --> 06:33.030
Thank you, guys.

06:33.122 --> 06:34.402
Thanks.

06:35.772 --> 06:37.052
Thanks.

06:38.682 --> 06:39.212
Done.

06:39.212 --> 06:40.492
Thanks.

06:51.412 --> 06:53.282
Did the tractor fall into the ditch?

06:53.282 --> 06:53.832
Yes.

06:53.832 --> 06:54.722
I was covered in mud.

06:54.722 --> 06:55.892
So I took a bath.

06:55.892 --> 06:57.012
Luckily, not late.

06:57.012 --> 06:58.452
I said I can go home on my own.

06:58.452 --> 07:00.784
I said I'll pick you up.

07:02.572 --> 07:03.852
You have inflammation.

07:03.852 --> 07:05.482
Because of bath water?

07:05.482 --> 07:06.123
Fine.

07:06.123 --> 07:07.572
I have no pain.

07:07.572 --> 07:08.682
Be careful.

07:08.682 --> 07:10.222
Or it'll leave scars.

07:10.572 --> 07:11.532
Got it.

07:11.532 --> 07:14.296
By seaside?

07:14.772 --> 07:16.042
A detour?

07:16.042 --> 07:18.254
See the sunset.

07:30.682 --> 07:31.962
Xie Zhiyao.

07:33.572 --> 07:35.412
Why do you take my photos?

07:36.012 --> 07:37.292
As a souvenir.

07:39.802 --> 07:41.630
You look like a tourist.

07:42.212 --> 07:44.124
I'm a tourist for sure.

07:44.452 --> 07:45.412
OK.

07:45.412 --> 07:46.692
A tourist.

07:47.572 --> 07:51.898
People like Baoping are thinking
about what food to give you.

07:51.922 --> 07:55.910
Having thought for a long time, I don't know
what to give you.

07:56.802 --> 07:58.282
Are you joking?

07:58.282 --> 08:00.290
You've given me a lot.

08:00.572 --> 08:02.004
What?

08:04.852 --> 08:06.012
Sunrise.

08:06.012 --> 08:07.292
Sunset.

08:07.722 --> 08:09.002
Starry sky.

08:09.572 --> 08:10.852
Wind.

08:11.242 --> 08:12.522
Courage.

08:13.602 --> 08:14.802
Hope.

08:14.802 --> 08:16.582
You can be more material.

08:20.412 --> 08:22.372
I think I'm richer than you.

08:23.482 --> 08:24.762
I have no loan.

08:49.572 --> 08:50.852
Beautiful.

09:03.972 --> 09:07.481
You've learned to enjoy
anytime and anywhere.

09:07.482 --> 09:09.010
Of course.

09:09.602 --> 09:12.102
These are the real luxuries.

09:32.522 --> 09:34.062
Why are you silent?

09:35.602 --> 09:37.046
Thinking about

09:37.292 --> 09:38.572
how to say.

09:39.242 --> 09:40.542
Say what?

09:41.292 --> 09:42.832
You can say anything.

10:09.902 --> 10:11.182
Parting gift.

10:13.212 --> 10:14.492
Self-made.

10:15.212 --> 10:16.852
It's not a valuable gadget.

10:16.852 --> 10:18.698
You may refuse pricey ones.

10:18.722 --> 10:20.002
Self-made?

10:20.072 --> 10:21.352
What's wrong?

10:32.122 --> 10:34.742
Why are the two rings buckled together?

10:35.362 --> 10:36.572
Magic.

10:36.572 --> 10:38.568
Balala dark energy.

10:45.812 --> 10:47.868
You don't like it?

10:48.522 --> 10:49.802
I like it.

10:50.642 --> 10:51.922
Thanks.

10:57.722 --> 10:59.852
Is your hand hurt?

10:59.852 --> 11:00.722
No.

11:00.722 --> 11:02.358
The tractor did that.

11:20.602 --> 11:21.812
Nice.

11:21.812 --> 11:23.092
Nice.

11:23.212 --> 11:24.003
You're pretty.

11:24.003 --> 11:25.543
Pretty in everything.

11:49.362 --> 11:50.642
Xu Hongdou.

12:03.002 --> 12:04.770
At the first sight,

12:05.482 --> 12:08.270
I thought you were upright and plain.

12:08.482 --> 12:12.938
Later, I thought you were
unlucky but interesting.

12:13.052 --> 12:15.384
Every time I ask you for help,

12:15.452 --> 12:18.672
you're seemingly
unwilling but always agree.

12:19.572 --> 12:20.852
In a word,

12:21.362 --> 12:22.842
I think you are...

12:26.242 --> 12:27.638
I think you are...

12:29.722 --> 12:31.002
Just OK.

12:33.932 --> 12:35.352
Just OK?

12:37.452 --> 12:41.620
Just the type I like.

12:45.292 --> 12:47.000
I feel happy every day

12:47.642 --> 12:49.614
when I am with you.

12:50.762 --> 12:54.702
I'm happy whether I'm busy or not.

12:55.522 --> 12:56.810
So happy that

12:58.292 --> 12:59.572
I'm a bit sad.

13:01.762 --> 13:05.522
Because the time and place
I met you are not so good.

13:07.722 --> 13:09.970
I even regret it sometimes.

13:11.052 --> 13:13.092
Because when I was in Beijing,

13:13.092 --> 13:15.788
I often passed the hotel where you worked,

13:15.812 --> 13:17.520
but I never walked in.

13:19.172 --> 13:23.964
If I went in, I could have known you earlier.

13:24.692 --> 13:29.292
Maybe there is another possibility between us.

13:33.362 --> 13:37.638
I intended to let these
words sink in my heart.

13:38.812 --> 13:40.232
But I thought long.

13:42.362 --> 13:43.722
Finally, I want to

13:45.292 --> 13:47.048
give you another memory.

13:49.122 --> 13:51.863
At the seaside, a place
where the wind blows,

13:53.002 --> 13:55.382
there is a man who really likes you

13:56.882 --> 14:01.462
under the witness of afterglow and sunset.

14:01.462 --> 14:03.948
♫ The saddle ♫

14:03.972 --> 14:10.720
♫ Of my heart ♫

14:11.382 --> 14:12.662
I make it clear.

14:14.122 --> 14:15.402
Xie Zhiyao.

14:15.762 --> 14:17.674
You're so bold.

14:18.212 --> 14:19.292
Unexpected?

14:19.292 --> 14:20.572
Directly.

14:22.362 --> 14:23.642
I can't take it.

14:24.362 --> 14:25.890
That's what I want.

14:30.002 --> 14:31.452
Well. Come on.

14:31.452 --> 14:32.872
Why are you crying?

14:32.932 --> 14:34.352
You needn't do it.

14:35.852 --> 14:39.252
♫ I'm searching for ♫

14:39.252 --> 14:44.092
♫ A meadow of mine ♫

14:45.292 --> 14:46.572
Thank you.

14:47.402 --> 14:48.978
I love this gift.

14:51.362 --> 14:52.642
You're welcome.

14:53.242 --> 14:54.522
Xu Hongdou.

14:56.002 --> 14:58.058
Live the life you want.

14:59.082 --> 15:00.502
Wish you happiness.

15:03.852 --> 15:05.852
♫ Would you ask for ♫

15:05.852 --> 15:07.428
Thank you.

15:08.502 --> 15:11.828
♫ This one inside your heart ♫

15:11.852 --> 15:15.592
♫ I'll give you the saddle ♫

15:15.592 --> 15:22.400
♫ Of my heart ♫

15:29.452 --> 15:30.732
Go home.

15:32.442 --> 15:35.752
♫ A feeling rushes over me ♫

15:35.752 --> 15:40.252
♫ Spills my heart into the field ♫

15:40.252 --> 15:46.952
♫ I know it I will be yours ♫

15:46.952 --> 15:50.052
♫ Would you ask for any horse ♫

15:50.052 --> 15:51.642
♫ But this one ♫

15:51.642 --> 15:52.482
Hongdou.

15:52.482 --> 15:53.782
Wish you safety.

15:54.482 --> 15:56.586
Inform me of the bookstore.

15:56.642 --> 15:57.792
Of course.

15:57.792 --> 15:58.383
Keep in touch.

15:58.383 --> 16:00.052
- Introduce resources to us.
- OK.

16:00.052 --> 16:02.428
I'll mail your baggage tonight.

16:02.452 --> 16:04.772
Send me nice food when you arrive.

16:05.902 --> 16:07.182
Wish you safety.

16:08.402 --> 16:12.846
Inform us in the group when
you arrive at your friend's home.

16:28.482 --> 16:29.762
Go.

16:46.852 --> 16:49.652
♫ Do you ever feel alone ♫

16:49.652 --> 16:52.552
♫ Standing in the road ♫

16:52.552 --> 16:56.192
♫ Don't know where to go ♫

16:57.352 --> 17:00.552
♫ In the air my memories flow ♫

17:00.552 --> 17:02.752
♫ Faces in a row ♫

17:02.752 --> 17:06.652
♫ Take a long way home ♫

17:06.652 --> 17:13.552
♫ But all of these remind me to believe ♫

17:13.552 --> 17:17.152
♫ No one will stay or leave ♫

17:17.152 --> 17:24.352
♫ And then all of these remind me to receive ♫

17:24.352 --> 17:28.952
♫ Life we can see ♫

17:33.852 --> 17:38.932
♫ The sun will rise and fall ♫

17:44.052 --> 17:50.092
♫ It's just another day ♫

18:21.292 --> 18:22.572
Go in.

18:23.012 --> 18:24.312
I'll see you off.

18:28.202 --> 18:29.482
Hug me.

18:32.602 --> 18:33.882
Come on.

18:34.682 --> 18:35.962
Go.

18:42.162 --> 18:43.582
I'd better hug you.

18:45.772 --> 18:47.432
What do you want to do?

19:03.312 --> 19:08.032
♫ The sun will rise and fall ♫

19:13.852 --> 19:20.132
♫ It's just another day ♫

19:21.852 --> 19:23.212
Wish you safety.

19:27.292 --> 19:28.572
See you.

19:28.922 --> 19:30.202
See you.

19:41.952 --> 19:44.652
♫ Do you ever feel alone ♫

19:44.652 --> 19:47.552
♫ Standing in the road ♫

19:47.552 --> 19:51.192
♫ Don't know where to go ♫

19:52.352 --> 19:55.552
♫ In the air my memories flow ♫

19:55.552 --> 19:57.752
♫ Faces in a row ♫

19:57.752 --> 20:01.652
♫ Take a long way home ♫

20:01.652 --> 20:08.552
♫ But all of these remind me to believe ♫

20:08.552 --> 20:12.152
♫ No one will stay or leave ♫

20:12.152 --> 20:19.352
♫ And then all of these remind me to receive ♫

20:19.352 --> 20:23.952
♫ Life we can see ♫

20:28.852 --> 20:33.932
♫ The sun will rise and fall ♫

20:39.052 --> 20:44.651
♫ It's just another day ♫

20:44.652 --> 20:51.552
♫ But all of these remind me to believe ♫

20:51.552 --> 20:55.152
♫ No one will stay or leave ♫

20:55.152 --> 21:02.352
♫ And then all of these remind me to receive ♫

21:02.352 --> 21:06.952
♫ Life we can see ♫

21:11.852 --> 21:16.932
♫ The sun will rise and fall ♫

21:18.442 --> 21:19.532
I'm too busy to remember it.

21:19.532 --> 21:20.812
She left today?

21:21.092 --> 21:22.572
Not tomorrow?

21:22.572 --> 21:24.962
Yes. Xie sent her off in person.

21:24.962 --> 21:28.614
Hongdou just sent a message
in the group that she has landed.

21:30.402 --> 21:32.508
He is so unlucky.

21:32.532 --> 21:34.642
He makes great effort to meet a loved girl.

21:34.642 --> 21:35.922
But in vain.

21:36.732 --> 21:40.036
Love should be tested by time.

21:40.162 --> 21:43.466
But it's been tested long with no result.

21:46.252 --> 21:47.540
Granny Xiuying!

21:48.072 --> 21:49.202
I'm coming.

21:49.202 --> 21:50.092
Don't touch it.

21:50.092 --> 21:50.882
Let me.

21:50.882 --> 21:52.302
It hurts your hand.

21:53.442 --> 21:55.462
Hongdou is much more careful.

21:56.362 --> 22:00.446
I have tried not to recall her time here.

22:05.732 --> 22:06.492
Is that her?

22:06.492 --> 22:07.172
Who?

22:07.172 --> 22:08.052
She's in white.

22:08.052 --> 22:09.162
Yes.

22:09.162 --> 22:09.922
Hongdou!

22:09.922 --> 22:10.402
Hongdou!

22:10.402 --> 22:11.402
Here!

22:11.402 --> 22:12.834
Uncle! Aunt!

22:14.292 --> 22:15.572
Come here!

22:16.252 --> 22:17.012
Arrived.

22:17.012 --> 22:17.982
Hongdou.

22:17.982 --> 22:19.262
You first.

22:19.922 --> 22:21.122
Let her have a rest.

22:21.122 --> 22:23.226
I'll cook for her.

22:23.362 --> 22:24.642
OK.

22:24.772 --> 22:26.052
Change shoes.

22:28.442 --> 22:29.722
Come in.

22:30.922 --> 22:32.510
It's Nanxing's room.

22:36.252 --> 22:37.362
Nanxing.

22:37.362 --> 22:39.142
Hongdou comes to see you.

22:40.402 --> 22:41.682
Are you happy?

23:21.532 --> 23:24.008
The room is a bit small.

23:24.572 --> 23:27.156
We burnt part of her belongings.

23:27.252 --> 23:30.556
The rest is for commemoration.

23:31.122 --> 23:32.052
Well.

23:32.052 --> 23:33.642
Your uncle and I sleep here.

23:33.642 --> 23:34.642
You sleep in our room.

23:34.642 --> 23:35.922
No, thanks.

23:36.052 --> 23:37.376
This room is OK.

23:37.852 --> 23:39.524
There's her scent here.

23:47.122 --> 23:48.202
Cheer up.

23:48.202 --> 23:49.482
Fine.

23:51.532 --> 23:52.812
Aunt.

23:52.962 --> 23:54.442
I bring many things.

23:54.492 --> 23:55.772
Have a look.

23:56.812 --> 23:58.642
You often send us food.

23:58.642 --> 24:00.482
But you bring a lot again.

24:01.162 --> 24:01.852
Cheers.

24:01.852 --> 24:03.332
Cheers.

24:05.642 --> 24:06.882
This wine is brewed by me.

24:06.882 --> 24:08.202
Like it?

24:08.202 --> 24:09.502
Tasty!

24:09.572 --> 24:10.852
Yes.

24:11.642 --> 24:14.492
Someone planted two vines near the east wall.

24:14.492 --> 24:15.732
They're stout.

24:15.732 --> 24:18.592
But the grapes are too sour.

24:19.502 --> 24:20.572
No one picks.

24:20.572 --> 24:23.228
Birds eat a lot, so do ants.

24:23.252 --> 24:24.882
Your aunt feels pitiful.

24:24.882 --> 24:27.082
So she picked some to make wine.

24:27.602 --> 24:28.882
Well.

24:29.362 --> 24:30.492
It's tasty.

24:30.492 --> 24:31.012
Yes.

24:31.012 --> 24:33.572
I shared the wine with many neighbors.

24:33.572 --> 24:37.452
Later, the vine became very popular.

24:37.682 --> 24:38.492
Don't just listen.

24:38.492 --> 24:39.163
Have a taste.

24:39.163 --> 24:40.572
I just wanted to say.

24:40.572 --> 24:41.053
Uncle.

24:41.053 --> 24:43.193
The chicken is quite delicious.

24:43.442 --> 24:44.092
Wait.

24:44.092 --> 24:45.402
You eat first.

24:45.402 --> 24:47.732
Let me take a video for my parents.

24:47.732 --> 24:48.922
OK.

24:48.922 --> 24:50.852
Stop. It'll be better in the video.

24:50.852 --> 24:52.602
I'm at Nanxing's home.

24:52.602 --> 24:55.774
Uncle cooked many dishes for me.

24:56.012 --> 24:58.980
The chicken is delicious.

24:59.332 --> 25:01.332
This is Uncle Chen, the great cook.

25:01.332 --> 25:03.292
Chicken to go is great.

25:04.532 --> 25:06.060
Pretty aunt.

25:06.402 --> 25:07.602
Finger heart.

25:07.602 --> 25:08.950
Finger heart.

25:10.202 --> 25:12.772
The wine is made by aunt.

25:12.772 --> 25:13.922
Very tasty.

25:13.922 --> 25:15.012
Made of sour grapes.

25:15.012 --> 25:15.392
Yes.

25:15.392 --> 25:17.112
But the wine's not sour.

25:18.922 --> 25:20.202
Well.

25:20.772 --> 25:22.572
Taste the fish.

25:22.572 --> 25:23.163
Wait.

25:23.163 --> 25:24.462
Let her eat.

25:34.122 --> 25:34.732
OK.

25:34.732 --> 25:35.642
Hurry up.

25:35.642 --> 25:37.794
Have a taste.

25:38.492 --> 25:39.772
Thank you.

25:39.772 --> 25:41.012
Master.

25:41.012 --> 25:42.882
Hit me once more.

25:42.882 --> 25:44.162
Go.

25:48.902 --> 25:50.502
Master, you're eating?

25:50.572 --> 25:51.532
Nonsense.

25:51.532 --> 25:52.904
Just two dishes.

25:53.852 --> 25:54.643
Stop shooting.

25:54.643 --> 25:55.532
Stop.

25:55.532 --> 25:56.362
What to shoot?

25:56.362 --> 25:58.012
I'm having lunch!

25:58.012 --> 25:59.292
Stop!

25:59.362 --> 26:00.442
Master.

26:00.442 --> 26:01.722
Look.

26:04.882 --> 26:06.326
You brat!

26:06.402 --> 26:07.852
You carved a dung beetle.

26:07.852 --> 26:09.284
Who will buy it?

26:10.162 --> 26:11.122
It's not carved.

26:11.122 --> 26:12.402
It's real.

26:13.052 --> 26:14.332
To frighten me?

26:14.332 --> 26:16.340
I don't mean to.

26:21.092 --> 26:22.092
Brat!

26:22.092 --> 26:22.772
No.

26:22.772 --> 26:23.732
I want to add a dish.

26:23.732 --> 26:24.812
It's nutritious.

26:24.812 --> 26:25.532
No.

26:25.532 --> 26:26.532
Don't hit me.

26:26.532 --> 26:27.532
Don't hit me.

26:27.532 --> 26:28.812
No.

26:57.092 --> 26:58.372
Yao.

27:00.152 --> 27:01.432
Come on.

27:03.572 --> 27:05.184
Chicken soup is ready.

27:06.902 --> 27:08.182
Have a try.

27:09.772 --> 27:12.922
The soup will make rice noodles tasty
tomorrow morning.

27:12.922 --> 27:14.402
Finish it.

27:14.402 --> 27:16.852
The rest is for rice noodles.

27:16.852 --> 27:17.772
Come on.

27:17.772 --> 27:19.300
I can drink myself.

27:19.572 --> 27:20.852
OK.

27:24.362 --> 27:26.046
Has Hongdou arrived?

27:27.402 --> 27:28.602
Maybe.

27:28.602 --> 27:30.794
She informed me when she landed.

27:31.122 --> 27:33.052
Has she had meals?

27:33.052 --> 27:34.952
Of course.

27:35.292 --> 27:36.882
Ask her.

27:36.882 --> 27:37.882
Ask what?

27:37.882 --> 27:39.746
What did she eat?

27:39.922 --> 27:41.402
No need to ask that.

27:42.012 --> 27:45.098
Keep in touch with her.

27:45.122 --> 27:46.602
Contact her when in need.

27:46.602 --> 27:48.202
Now there's reason to contact.

27:48.202 --> 27:52.718
If you don't contact her, change it.

27:53.292 --> 27:55.684
OK, I'll change it later.

27:56.852 --> 27:59.492
You're totally unlike me.

27:59.492 --> 28:02.772
When I pursued your
grandpa at a young age,

28:02.772 --> 28:05.008
I followed him everywhere.

28:05.292 --> 28:06.292
Granny.

28:06.292 --> 28:08.300
You're a hopeless romantic.

28:08.642 --> 28:10.038
What?

28:10.362 --> 28:13.042
It refers to someone good at courting.

28:14.012 --> 28:14.922
Not the case.

28:14.922 --> 28:17.468
I just fell in love with him.

28:17.492 --> 28:19.252
I'm not like you.

28:19.252 --> 28:22.012
I'm very happy since Xu Hongdou has left.

28:22.012 --> 28:26.852
The beauty has greatly hindered my career.

28:27.442 --> 28:30.028
You're just firm in speech.

28:30.052 --> 28:31.052
Drink!

28:31.052 --> 28:32.484
I will.

29:01.642 --> 29:02.682
1.

29:02.682 --> 29:03.732
2.

29:03.732 --> 29:04.772
3.

29:04.772 --> 29:05.682
4.

29:05.682 --> 29:06.682
It dropped.

29:06.682 --> 29:08.162
It needs a knack.

29:08.162 --> 29:09.202
Like me.

29:09.202 --> 29:10.882
Move in this way. Yes.

29:10.882 --> 29:12.012
Great.

29:12.012 --> 29:13.092
Go.

29:13.092 --> 29:14.362
Xiaomei.

29:14.362 --> 29:16.292
Is she your niece or sister's daughter?

29:16.292 --> 29:17.532
My goddaughter.

29:17.532 --> 29:19.492
She came to see me from Beijing.

29:19.492 --> 29:20.780
Goddaughter?

29:20.882 --> 29:21.922
Beijing is very far.

29:21.922 --> 29:23.202
Great.

29:23.602 --> 29:26.402
She often mails food and drinks to me.

29:26.402 --> 29:27.682
That's good.

29:32.852 --> 29:34.092
Aunt.

29:34.092 --> 29:37.532
Chen Nanxing told me that
it took her a day to be born.

29:37.532 --> 29:39.532
When she was born the next morning,

29:39.532 --> 29:42.852
uncle saw only one Antarctic star in the sky.

29:42.852 --> 29:44.632
So she was named Nanxing.

29:44.812 --> 29:46.292
I was cheated for a long time.

29:46.292 --> 29:48.372
A few days ago, I learned that

29:48.402 --> 29:51.982
Antarctic star can't be seen in the northern
hemisphere.

29:55.682 --> 29:58.228
She was named by her grandfather.

29:58.252 --> 30:01.052
He planted a rhizoma arisaematis (Nanxing)
in the yard.

30:01.052 --> 30:03.252
It didn't need much water to grow well.

30:03.252 --> 30:04.332
Luxuriantly green.

30:04.332 --> 30:06.202
So he called her Nanxing.

30:06.202 --> 30:06.988
Yes.

30:07.012 --> 30:09.012
She hated the name when she was young.

30:09.012 --> 30:12.892
She said her name is the same as
the grass in grandpa's yard.

30:16.052 --> 30:18.192
Pick some apples.

30:20.642 --> 30:21.532
This one is not good.

30:21.532 --> 30:22.602
Let mom tell you.

30:22.602 --> 30:23.882
Apple...

30:27.012 --> 30:27.882
Let aunt tell you.

30:27.882 --> 30:33.206
Apples with vertical stripes are sweet.

30:44.472 --> 30:45.642
What's this? Let me see.

30:45.642 --> 30:46.922
Hair dye cream.

30:47.092 --> 30:48.402
It's not good. Not good.

30:48.402 --> 30:49.930
Why?

30:51.532 --> 30:52.122
No.

30:52.122 --> 30:52.572
No.

30:52.572 --> 30:53.292
Too expensive.

30:53.292 --> 30:54.053
Doing what?

30:54.053 --> 30:55.332
We're not young.

30:55.332 --> 30:56.944
We don't need it.

31:05.162 --> 31:06.442
459 yuan.

31:07.952 --> 31:09.292
You don't have to pay.

31:09.292 --> 31:10.572
No, thanks.

31:10.882 --> 31:11.292
Hey!

31:11.292 --> 31:12.052
Scanned?

31:12.052 --> 31:13.332
Yes.

31:22.402 --> 31:23.202
Hongdou.

31:23.202 --> 31:25.402
She has more gray hair at the top.

31:25.402 --> 31:26.532
Apply more there.

31:26.532 --> 31:28.362
Don't give arbitrary orders.

31:28.362 --> 31:29.682
She is more careful.

31:29.682 --> 31:31.092
I'm enjoying it.

31:31.092 --> 31:32.372
Not necessarily.

31:32.602 --> 31:34.012
Uncle is more experienced.

31:34.012 --> 31:35.292
It's my first time.

31:35.292 --> 31:37.012
He has poor eyesight.

31:37.012 --> 31:39.828
He often dyes unevenly due to poor eyesight.

31:39.852 --> 31:41.532
No, I don't.

31:41.532 --> 31:43.348
I have sharp eyes.

31:47.882 --> 31:48.572
OK.

31:48.572 --> 31:49.772
Wait for dyeing.

31:49.772 --> 31:50.293
Have a rest.

31:50.293 --> 31:51.642
Hongdou, come on.

31:51.642 --> 31:52.572
Have some tea.

31:52.572 --> 31:53.852
OK.

31:56.922 --> 31:57.772
Are your hands dyed?

31:57.772 --> 31:59.092
No.

31:59.092 --> 32:00.656
Good job.

32:02.922 --> 32:04.202
Let me shoot.

32:04.442 --> 32:05.722
Shoot?

32:06.012 --> 32:07.162
Hey, you!

32:07.162 --> 32:08.442
Come on.

32:09.492 --> 32:11.442
Lajiao.

32:11.442 --> 32:13.894
Qiezi.

32:19.402 --> 32:22.442
Your mouth is like a catfish.

32:22.442 --> 32:22.923
No.

32:22.923 --> 32:23.772
Too ugly.

32:23.772 --> 32:24.573
This one is better.

32:24.573 --> 32:26.178
It's creative.

32:26.202 --> 32:27.332
Deleted. Once again.

32:27.332 --> 32:28.612
Once more.

32:43.442 --> 32:44.722
Tasty.

32:51.882 --> 32:54.622
Rice noodles are ready. Who wants to eat?

33:09.252 --> 33:09.813
Mr. Hu.

33:09.813 --> 33:11.833
Ask Xiaochun to eat together.

33:14.092 --> 33:15.828
They were all chatting.

33:15.852 --> 33:18.196
No one listened to my song.

33:18.332 --> 33:21.772
Someone ordered an online popular song.

33:21.772 --> 33:23.052
But just a part.

33:23.122 --> 33:24.402
Well...

33:25.772 --> 33:27.052
Mr. Hu.

33:27.052 --> 33:28.712
Rice noodles are ready.

33:29.772 --> 33:30.053
Nana.

33:30.053 --> 33:31.202
I have to go to town.

33:31.202 --> 33:32.402
My first song today.

33:32.402 --> 33:33.682
I won't eat.

33:34.532 --> 33:35.802
How about Xiaochun?

33:35.802 --> 33:36.952
I don't have dinner.

33:36.952 --> 33:38.682
I'll hear him sing in the bar.

33:38.682 --> 33:39.812
See you.

33:39.812 --> 33:40.122
Bye.

33:40.122 --> 33:40.852
Bye-bye.

33:40.852 --> 33:42.132
Bye-bye.

33:42.292 --> 33:43.904
What's more,

33:44.052 --> 33:45.712
you sang on stage...

33:45.852 --> 33:47.452
Too many rice noodles.

34:25.772 --> 34:27.652
I wrote materials for a day.

34:27.652 --> 34:29.362
A meeting in town tomorrow.

34:29.362 --> 34:29.813
And you?

34:29.813 --> 34:31.473
What are you busy with?

34:31.962 --> 34:34.652
Today, a guest fell while riding at the
racetrack.

34:34.652 --> 34:36.252
He was X-rayed in the hospital.

34:36.252 --> 34:37.472
Is he badly hurt?

34:37.472 --> 34:38.692
Thanks to protective gear.

34:38.692 --> 34:40.364
Soft tissue contusion.

34:41.962 --> 34:42.852
Nana.

34:42.852 --> 34:43.692
What did you cook?

34:43.692 --> 34:45.268
Enough for us two?

34:47.612 --> 34:48.892
What's wrong?

34:50.612 --> 34:51.362
I'm OK.

34:51.362 --> 34:52.890
That's enough. Wait.

35:17.082 --> 35:21.691
You want to cry just because
no one eats the rice noodles?

35:21.692 --> 35:22.972
No.

35:25.172 --> 35:30.672
I feel like I haven't eaten alone for
a long time.

35:31.612 --> 35:32.892
Suddenly I saw

35:33.402 --> 35:35.172
the lights in every room were off.

35:35.172 --> 35:36.452
So...

35:37.852 --> 35:39.284
So I feel

35:39.772 --> 35:41.348
a bit lonely.

35:42.612 --> 35:44.608
Well, I'm too unreasonable.

35:44.922 --> 35:46.450
I don't think so.

35:46.652 --> 35:49.872
You're just not used to the feeling of
separation.

35:52.212 --> 35:52.922
Look.

35:52.922 --> 35:54.922
I'm a strong girl.

35:54.922 --> 35:56.562
Once I went to see my mom with my dad.

35:56.562 --> 36:00.442
But I cried in the car as soon as I left.

36:01.132 --> 36:02.756
Your mom must be sad.

36:02.812 --> 36:03.443
Come on.

36:03.443 --> 36:05.612
She was very happy.

36:05.612 --> 36:09.588
After we came, she was busy
with cooking and her work.

36:09.652 --> 36:11.332
No way.

36:11.332 --> 36:12.882
She's just firm in speech.

36:12.882 --> 36:13.922
It's true.

36:13.922 --> 36:18.042
My boyfriend told me in secret
that my mom breathed a sigh of relief

36:18.042 --> 36:19.172
after we left.

36:19.172 --> 36:22.704
She compared dad and me
to the importunate Buddhas.

36:24.332 --> 36:26.520
Your mother is my idol.

36:27.332 --> 36:29.148
Am I not your idol?

36:29.522 --> 36:32.826
I've loved Principal Tao for a long time.

36:33.512 --> 36:35.252
What about my backup club?

36:35.252 --> 36:36.828
Quietly dissolved.

36:40.082 --> 36:41.362
Great.

36:41.772 --> 36:43.052
Sorry.

36:44.252 --> 36:47.332
What you said is too bleak.

36:47.332 --> 36:49.042
Yes, it's bleak.

36:49.042 --> 36:50.322
They all left.

36:53.362 --> 36:54.612
Don't worry.

36:54.612 --> 36:56.292
New tenants will come.

36:56.292 --> 36:58.528
The windows will be illuminated.

36:59.772 --> 37:01.052
No.

37:02.052 --> 37:03.532
No matter who comes,

37:04.652 --> 37:05.952
Damai and Hongdou

37:07.772 --> 37:09.156
won't come.

37:21.002 --> 37:22.914
Don't cry.

37:23.482 --> 37:25.442
Xie, don't be sad.

37:34.522 --> 37:35.802
Look.

37:58.652 --> 38:00.180
I put a photo here.

38:00.212 --> 38:02.016
Go to bed early.

38:02.082 --> 38:03.362
Aunt.

38:04.442 --> 38:05.722
Well.

38:09.212 --> 38:10.692
I'll leave tomorrow.

38:12.452 --> 38:13.652
Go to bed with me.

38:13.652 --> 38:15.552
Tell me more about Nanxing.

38:27.852 --> 38:31.336
A friend told me

38:32.002 --> 38:34.502
when we talk about a person,

38:35.042 --> 38:36.426
she exists;

38:37.852 --> 38:39.908
when we don't talk about her,

38:43.882 --> 38:45.162
she disappears.

38:46.522 --> 38:48.734
Let's talk more about her.

39:03.442 --> 39:05.690
She was 100 days old then.

39:07.172 --> 39:08.522
She was one year old.

39:08.522 --> 39:10.062
Her grandma held her.

39:13.212 --> 39:15.592
She was fat then.

39:16.172 --> 39:17.362
She was big.

39:17.362 --> 39:19.482
It took me two days to give birth to her.

39:19.482 --> 39:21.922
She weighed 3.9 kilograms when born.

39:22.042 --> 39:23.402
Her whole body was red.

39:23.402 --> 39:25.978
She was frowning and crying.

39:26.002 --> 39:29.002
I looked at her and was shocked.

39:29.002 --> 39:32.030
I said I had an ugly daughter.

39:37.692 --> 39:39.976
She entered primary school then.

39:41.132 --> 39:43.522
Someone sold marinated
chicken legs, namely, drumsticks,

39:43.522 --> 39:45.542
outside her father's company.

39:45.772 --> 39:48.260
She ate one every day.

39:48.482 --> 39:52.082
Other kids were fastidious about food.

39:52.082 --> 39:54.042
But she was not.

39:54.042 --> 39:55.630
She ate any food.

39:57.812 --> 39:59.472
She became thinner.

39:59.652 --> 40:00.932
Yes.

40:03.002 --> 40:04.722
Uncle was handsome then.

40:06.402 --> 40:09.034
She may be in middle school then.

40:09.212 --> 40:10.562
It was her grandma's birthday.

40:10.562 --> 40:11.994
There's a cake.

40:13.292 --> 40:17.988
She became thinner because she
ate less and wanted to be pretty.

40:20.882 --> 40:22.854
She became taller than me.

40:30.082 --> 40:31.502
She's like her dad.

40:32.292 --> 40:33.572
Right?

40:54.692 --> 40:57.120
When Nanxing just passed away,

40:58.252 --> 41:00.992
your uncle and I were utterly dissipated.

41:02.292 --> 41:04.972
We were silent at home.

41:05.442 --> 41:07.942
We turned on TV but didn't watch it.

41:09.252 --> 41:10.780
When we missed her,

41:11.292 --> 41:13.668
we came to this room

41:13.692 --> 41:14.972
and cried.

41:16.362 --> 41:18.262
When tired, we went to bed.

41:19.962 --> 41:22.546
It's like a nightmare.

41:23.362 --> 41:24.710
Not real.

41:28.402 --> 41:31.658
Relatives and neighbors

41:32.082 --> 41:37.066
came to see us out of kindness.

41:38.362 --> 41:41.234
They cried with us.

41:42.902 --> 41:44.862
I was afraid of being asked.

41:50.522 --> 41:51.802
Hongdou.

41:56.332 --> 42:01.496
I always wonder if I did
something bad in my last life.

42:03.922 --> 42:10.346
I have accomplished nothing in my life.

42:18.402 --> 42:20.758
I'm really grateful to you.

42:22.442 --> 42:25.074
You often called us then.

42:27.082 --> 42:29.918
You asked what we ate and did.

42:31.562 --> 42:33.474
But we couldn't answer.

42:34.812 --> 42:37.768
Then you made a video call.

42:39.922 --> 42:44.870
Due to sadness, I didn't notice.

42:45.132 --> 42:47.032
Your uncle is more careful.

42:47.292 --> 42:49.348
He asked me

42:49.652 --> 42:51.504
if I noticed that

42:52.332 --> 42:55.864
Hongdou was not energetic.

42:59.522 --> 43:02.442
We... We are just too selfish.

43:02.442 --> 43:04.846
We only think about ourselves.

43:05.212 --> 43:09.620
We don't notice others must be sad, too.

43:19.292 --> 43:22.362
Nanxing's aunt is eaten up with diseases.

43:22.362 --> 43:25.342
But she often cooks and sends the food to us.

43:26.562 --> 43:30.742
My nephew and niece are busy with work,

43:31.082 --> 43:33.618
but they often take time to visit us.

43:38.132 --> 43:41.280
Your uncle persuaded me

43:43.882 --> 43:46.142
to let Nanxing pass away at ease.

43:46.962 --> 43:48.970
We must look forward.

43:51.362 --> 43:53.522
In fact, I'm enlightened.

43:53.522 --> 43:54.810
I'm fine.

43:56.772 --> 43:58.492
I'll go through it soon.

44:01.562 --> 44:04.302
We'll meet underground.

44:12.212 --> 44:14.188
We're fine.

44:14.212 --> 44:15.482
Don't worry.

44:15.482 --> 44:16.253
We're fine.

44:16.253 --> 44:22.308
Now we exercise and eat well every day.

44:22.332 --> 44:23.652
Don't worry.

44:23.652 --> 44:25.492
You don't have to send food to us.

44:28.082 --> 44:34.590
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

44:35.522 --> 44:41.406
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

44:42.932 --> 44:49.301
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

44:49.302 --> 44:55.702
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

44:57.642 --> 45:04.054
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

45:05.012 --> 45:10.788
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

45:12.442 --> 45:18.971
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

45:18.972 --> 45:26.344
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

45:27.252 --> 45:33.692
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

45:33.692 --> 45:41.692
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

45:41.822 --> 45:43.872
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

45:43.872 --> 45:48.501
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

45:48.502 --> 45:56.842
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

46:00.512 --> 46:06.648
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

46:07.842 --> 46:14.218
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

46:15.232 --> 46:21.652
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

46:21.652 --> 46:29.652
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

46:30.012 --> 46:36.462
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

46:36.462 --> 46:44.466
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

46:44.672 --> 46:46.652
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

46:46.652 --> 46:51.252
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

46:51.252 --> 46:58.611
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

46:58.612 --> 47:06.628
♫ Go to a windy place to meet you ♫
